    "Name": "SRM Carrier (Prim.)",
    "Details": "Not designed for traditional combat, the Carrier is a force multiplier. Designed to support allies from range, the Carrier can hang back behind friendly lines where its lack of armor isn't a concern.\n\n<b><color=#ffcc00>Biome Restrictions: This unit can not deploy in Lunar or Martian biomes due to using an ICE.</color></b>\n\n<b><color=#ffcc00>Movement: 3/5 hexes / 90/150 meters.</color></b>\n\n<color=#ffcc00><b>Armor:</b> Primitive Armor\n<b>Structure:</b> Structure\n<b>Values       A        S  </b>\n<b>Front</b>       160     30\n<b>Left</b>         130     30\n<b>Right</b>       130     30\n<b>Rear</b>        120     30\n\n<b>Total</b>      540    120</color>\n\n<color=#ff0000>Quirk: Narrow/Low Profile</color>",
